---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact Eddie at Lowcountry Digital Works about a website, application, automation, transition, maintenance, or technical problem.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container readable"><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><h1>Start with the problem you need to solve.</h1><p class="lede">You do not need a detailed technical specification. A short description of what is happening now and what you want to improve is enough to start a conversation.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container readable"><h2>Email Eddie</h2><p><a class="button" href="mailto:eddie@lowcountrydigitalworks.com">eddie@lowcountrydigitalworks.com</a></p><div class="meta-note"><strong>Please keep ordinary email appropriate for ordinary email.</strong><p>Do not send passwords, MFA or recovery codes, private keys, API tokens, payment-card information, PHI, or other sensitive secrets in an initial message.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
